sections.body:
Every screen uses the Medha theme. Build new screens from the shells and components in `src/components/medha/`, and copy markup from the theme pages in `src/medha/pages/` (browse them at `/dashboard/components`); their class names carry the Medha style.

Colours come from the `--medha-*` design tokens, so the colour-scheme selector in the topbar can re-colour the whole app. Never hard-code colours or add another UI kit.

A new workspace page:

```tsx
import { AppShell, PageHeading, Panel } from "./components/medha";

export function ReportsPage() {
  return (
    <AppShell title="Reports">
      <PageHeading eyebrow="WORKSPACE" title="Reports" description="Monthly figures." />
      <Panel title="This month">…</Panel>
    </AppShell>
  );
}
```

Then add `<Route path="/dashboard/reports" element={<ReportsPage />} />` to `src/App.tsx` and a link to `src/medha/chrome/Sidebar.tsx`.
